{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/254049-copying-the-mask","id":254049,"title":"Copying the Mask","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-10T06:01:35-07:00","id":254049,"title":"Copying the Mask","content":"So lately I play <a href=\"http://youtu.be/QIgx0vPPDtA\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Wolf Among Us</i></a>, very <b>Changling</b>-like episodic graphic adventure video game based on Bill Willingham's <i>Fables</i> comic book series. Character in there are fairy tale beings that left they magical land and now are hiding in the New York neighborhood. They otherworldly nature is concealed with powerful effect that is very similar to Mask of the Lost ( called, funny, Glamour, in the game world <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ). But character can't see past the <i>WAU</i>'s Glamour, unless the person don't throw it away.<br /> <br /> My question is this: <b>In <i>Wolf Among Us</i> the spell of Glamour can duplicate the appearance of other character. If there is way to copy the Mask of other changling? In a way it can't be pierce thought? Basically - can I copy some other Lost appearance and NOT be caught on this?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T06:43:12-07:00","id":254078,"title":"","content":"Yes and no. The entire Mirrorskin kith and contracts of mirror revolve around copying others. But nothing is fool proof. (There are some very SOLID powers that can defeat trickery)<br /> <br /> A mirrorskin using its innate gets a +3 to a wits+Subterfuge diceroll for disguise... and can mimic anyone, mask and all.<br /> <br /> Alternatively MIrror 2: Skinmask can be used multiple times to achieve this and does not need a disguise roll... though can be costly to continue unless you invoke the catch.<br /> <br /> Ther emight be some other powers that do similar in other game lines, but they wouldn't be quite as good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T06:57:56-07:00","id":254080,"title":"","content":"Well, not to spoil this awesome game, but the Glamour in Wolf Among Us isn't <i>quite</i> foolproof as you say it is, actually. It has minor flaws, and it mostly depends on enchanted objects : once you take them away, the Mask's gone for good.<br /> <br /> And by the way, this game is such a great inspiration for Changeling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T06:59:13-07:00","id":254083,"title":"","content":"There's not really such a thing as a perfect illusion in WoD. There's always some way to get through anything if you try hard enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T07:20:48-07:00","id":254095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/254049-copying-the-mask?p=254080#post254080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, not to spoil this awesome game, but the Glamour in Wolf Among Us isn't <i>quite</i> foolproof as you say it is, actually. It has minor flaws, and it mostly depends on enchanted objects : once you take them away, the Mask's gone for good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Goblin Contract maybe? It's &quot;black market magic&quot;, isn't it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T07:58:22-07:00","id":254115,"title":"","content":"That or a token, put a drop of someone's blood on it to take their face, but if the token ever ceases to touch your skin the face is gone forever (or something to that effect)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/807-arcadianawakened","name":"ArcadianAwakened","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}